<title>NEW ZEALAND: JP Morgan Investments lifts Lion stake.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan Investments lifts Lion stake.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Investment Management Australia Ltd said on Friday it had lifted its relevant interest in New Zealand brewer Lion Nathan Ltd to 6.74 percent from 5.43 percent. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
